                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baadhi ya wana wa Manase walimwangukia Daudi, alipokwenda pamoja na Wafilisti juu ya Sauli vitani, lakini hawakuwasaidia; kwani wale mabwana wa Wafilisti wakafanya shauri, wakamfukuza, wakisema, tunahatarisha maisha yetu maana atamwangukia bwana wake Sauli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye alipokuwa akienda Siklagi, Manase hawa wakamwangukia, Adna, na Yozabadi, na Yediaeli, na Mikaeli, na Yozabadi, na Elihu, na Silethai, makamanda wa maelfu waliokuwa wa Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.30.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 30:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wakamsaidia Daudi juu ya kile kikosi kilichomshambulia; kwani walikuwa wanaume mashujaa wote, nao wakawa makamanda jeshini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana siku baada ya siku watu waliomwendea Daudi ili kumsaidia, hadi wakapata kuwa jeshi kubwa, kama jeshi la Mungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
